--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
BENCH / TOPOLOGY AS TESTED
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  DUT / querier : u4  S/N 264A23052  MAC 84e3.2787.09c0   (IGMP snooping querier, L3 IGMP)
  Source        : u5  S/N 264A23066  MAC 84e3.2787.0740
  Receiver/host : tb470 eth2 10.10.10.20/27  ->  u4 port1.0.2 (vlan10 access)
  Fabric        : one vlan10 (10.10.10.0/27) trunk  u4 port1.0.24 <-> u5 port2.0.24.
                  The 2nd u4<->u5 link (port*.0.26) is held shutdown so vlan10 is loop-free.

METHOD / SCOPE
  No IXIA on this bench. RECEIVER = tb470 host sending REAL IGMPv3 membership reports
  (scapy; ASM join = CHANGE_TO_EXCLUDE with empty source list; leave = CHANGE_TO_INCLUDE
  with empty source list; src 10.10.10.20 to pass the DUT source-address check) and counting
  frames with tcpdump; SOURCE = u5 `ping <group>` at 1 pps. Functional, NOT line rate.

